0774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outstanding Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Adorable shota and furry characters, along with their pure and passionate friendships.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich and engaging interactive elements, such as simulating petting a puppy or washing off dust...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An emotionally moving storyline with dual endings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Completed chapters can be replayed, allowing you to unlock different endings with minimal effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/1155ea91ab55509c82af3a73eee1f721.poster.avif?t=1766810774\" width=810 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/1155ea91ab55509c82af3a73eee1f721.webm?t=1766810774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/1155ea91ab55509c82af3a73eee1f721.mp4?t=1766810774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Plot:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A street-dwelling young man named Akuro endured constant bullying until the treasure hunter Bahaku appeared and took him on a journey. Under Bahaku's guidance, Akuro gradually learned how to explore ancient ruins and became a capable treasure hunter in his own right. Their friendship grew stronger with each passing day. However, one day, they uncovered a hidden secret within the ancient ruins...</p>",
